===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|вѣдѣ}}. Russian {{m|ru|ведь}} is a former {{der|ru|ine-pro|-}} root [[perfect tense|perfect]] {{m|ine-pro|*wóyde}} with [[mediopassive]] ending ''-ai'', with meaning "I have seen". Cognate with {{cog|en|wit}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-{{PAGENAME}}.ogg|audio}}

===Interjection===
{{head|ru|interjection}}

# [[after all]]
# [[indeed]], [[surely]]
# [[why]], [[well]]
# [[then]], you know, you see
# isn’t it?
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Ведь''' [[уже́]] [[по́здно]]|It’s late, isn’t it?}}
